{"segs": ["PA_ja_289:0.1"], "en": "Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_289:0.2"], "en": "Tikanipāta,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_289:0.3"], "en": "Abbhantaravagga (The Section on Inner Relatives)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_289:0.4"], "en": "9. The Jātaka of Diverse Desires:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_289:1.1", "PA_ja_289:1.2"], "en": "\"O Great King, we dwell in a single house with diverse desires.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_289:1.3"], "en": "I would desire an excellent village,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_289:1.4"], "en": "and my wife a hundred cows;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_289:2.1"], "en": "and our son a chariot drawn by thoroughbred horses.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_289:2.2"], "en": "The maiden with the jeweled earrings,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_289:2.3", "PA_ja_289:2.4"], "en": "and this wretched Puṇṇikā who longs for a mortar.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_289:3.1"], "en": "To the brahmin, an excellent village;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_289:3.2"], "en": "to the brahmin’s wife, a hundred cows;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_289:3.3"], "en": "to his son, a chariot drawn by thoroughbred horses.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_289:3.4"], "en": "The jeweled earring of the maiden,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_289:3.5"], "en": "and this wicked Puṇṇikā—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_289:3.6"], "en": "place them both upon the torture stake.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_289:4.1"], "en": "The Nānāchanda Jātaka, the ninth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
